{"id":"u-3409b19a-7517-497a-9895-5470bb41d329","src":"community","title":"3 Day Full Body + Cardio","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/YzpikP-3-day-full-body-cardio-1","desc":"This workout program is built on fully exhausting muscles on the final set. Results will rely heavily on effort put into these final sets and strict rest times (no more than 2 minutes for non supersets)\n\nHow to Progress:\nStart on the lower rep range and progress in reps each week for working sets. For final sets with no target rep range, perform as many as possible (until failure). If on the final set, you still fall between the range of the previous working sets, raise the working set reps and stay at the same weight.\n\nIf you are able to do 50% more reps on the final set than upper rep range, increase the working sets to the max of rep range or consider increasing weight. \n\nOnce all sets meet or exceed upper rep range, increase weight the following week.\n\nImportant keys to maximum strength and size:\n1. Consistency\n2. Progression\n3. Rest\n3. Diet\n4. Sleep\n5. Exercise Form","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-04-29T14:59:28.121Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1 Chest and Arms Focus","Day 2 Back and Shoulders Focus","Day 3 Leg Focus"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":2},{"lo":5}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":2},{"lo":5}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2},{"lo":10}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":600,"secHi":1200}],"note":"10 Incline 3.5 MPH"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":2},{"lo":5}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Plate Loaded)"